WEBVTT

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:33.996
The effects of cortisol on the brain
can be reversed in several ways.

00:03:34.038 --> 00:03:37.038
The most powerful weapons
are sport and meditation

00:03:37.079 --> 00:03:39.121
which involve deep breathing

00:03:39.163 --> 00:03:42.163
and awareness and focus
on one’s surroundings.

00:03:42.746 --> 00:03:46.829
These two activities reduce stress
and increase the size of the hippocampus

00:03:46.871 --> 00:03:49.496
and by doing so improve memory.

00:03:50.788 --> 00:03:54.663
So don’t let the pressures
of everyday life pull you down.

00:03:54.829 --> 00:03:58.538
But control your stress
before it controls you.